{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，醫學及衞生服務界15名當選人分別是陳衍里、陳玉嬋、陳肇始、梁禮賢、郭寶賢、梁嘉傑、羅鳳儀、莫樹錦、陳偉強、徐錫漢、李夏茵、容樹恒、陳真光、蘇潔瑩、梁世民。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.684682+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:08:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:57:48.972195+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:37:28.081212+00:00","content_hash":"26ae69f66f40de3904828f1e43ff6f2128e02c654ee7074a925809741fe1d865","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}